    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Inviting",
     "texto": [
      "**Θέλεις να πάμε…;** means «do you want us to go…?». To accept: **Ναι, ευχαρίστως!** (Yes, I'd love to!). To decline politely: **Συγγνώμη, δεν μπορώ** (I'm sorry, I can't).",
      "**Πότε;** asks when; **το Σάββατο** means Saturday. For a date, ordinal numbers are used in fixed expressions: **στις δέκα Μαΐου** (the tenth of May)."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
